flowchart TB
    A[Post-Commit Conflict] --> B[Repair First]
    B --> C{Evidence Converges?}
    C -- Yes --> D[Keep Match + Honest ETA Update]
    C -- No --> E{Redispatch Budget Available?}
    E -- Yes --> F[Controlled Reassignment]
    E -- No --> G[Escalate / Assisted Handling]
    F --> H{Disruption Threshold Crossed?}
    H -- Yes --> I[Compensate Rider/Driver]
    H -- No --> J[Continue]
    I --> K[Replay Record]
    J --> K
    G --> K
